680px){header,main{padding:22px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2 span{display:block;margin:6px 0 15px}.copy p{min-height:0}}
+</style><header><div class="eyebrow">BEAT MY TRACK / ARTIST COLLECTION 02</div><h1>Six cars.<br>Eighteen artworks.</h1><p>Three illustrated collector wraps per car. Full-colour painted imagery, individual bonnet portraits and side murals, rendered on the actual game models. Compare each artwork with the stock paint using the view buttons.</p><nav id="filters"></nav></header><main id="gallery"></main><footer>Artist collection - Original full-colour illustrations created offline with the built-in imagegen tool. The original car geometry and physical paint finishes are retained. The first collection remains archived. Real-money products and Garage availability remain a separate release step.<br>Every view here is a native Compatibility render. Desktop Mobile captures and check reports are retained alongside this gallery. Physical-device and owner visual acceptance remain.</footer><dialog id="lightbox"><div class="toolbar"><strong></strong><button onclick="document.querySelector('dialog').close()">Close ×</button></div><img alt=""></dialog><script>
+const designs=__DATA__,vehicles=__VEHICLES__,directions=__DIRECTIONS__;
